<div class="sn-idp-top"><div><section class="sn-intro" aria-label="SANDHĀTĀ introduction"><div class="sn-brand"><svg class="sn-mark" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="24" r="20" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#F4C430" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m31 13-4 16-13 6 6-14Z" fill="#164B99"/><path d="m31 13-4 16-7-8Z" fill="#F4C430"/><circle cx="24" cy="25" r="2" fill="#FFFFFF"/></svg><h1>SANDHĀTĀ</h1><span class="sn-descriptor">Career Intelligence</span></div><p class="sn-tagline">Find your direction. Advance with confidence.</p><div class="sn-expansion" aria-label="The meaning of SANDHĀTĀ"><div><span><b>S</b>earch</span><i aria-hidden="true"> · </i><span><b>A</b>nalyze</span><i aria-hidden="true"> · </i><span><b>N</b>avigate</span><i aria-hidden="true"> · </i><span><b>D</b>iscover</span></div><div><span><b>H</b>ighlight</span><i aria-hidden="true"> · </i><span><b>A</b>pply</span><i aria-hidden="true"> · </i><span><b>T</b>rack</span><i aria-hidden="true"> · </i><span><b>A</b>dvance</span></div></div><p class="sn-summary">Discover opportunities, compare your strengths, and bring every next step into focus.</p></section><section class="sn-features" aria-label="Career intelligence features"><h2>Built for your next chapter</h2><div class="sn-feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg><strong>Discover opportunities</strong><span>Search supported feeds for roles that fit your goals.</span></div><div class="sn-feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h10l4 4v14H5Z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M8 12h8M8 16h6"/></svg><strong>Bring your sources together</strong><span>Save complete postings from your premium searches.</span></div><div class="sn-feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fil